                                   mao:pressure_bridge ,
                                   mao:stay_bridge ,
                                   mao:subdue_bridge ;
                    rdfs:description "左轉吊左脚同時左邊擸掌成蝴蝶掌；進左子午馬左側推出蝴蝶掌，轉身回四平馬右擸手，緊接轉右子午馬左手逼踭；轉左子午馬左分漏手，左掌以踭勁帶動向左切出，右掌護左肩。"@zh-hk ;
                    rdfs:label "taming_tiger_52"@en ;
                    mao:name_en "Butterfly palm strike followed by the arm drag and forcing elbow strike combo to hit via splitting the opponent's body block"@en ;
                    mao:name_zh "蝶掌一迫分漏手"@zh-hk .


