    mao:has_description "側掌:白方運用割手後再以側掌打向黑方胸部·黑方即時以單弓手消去 | 獵手:黑方順勢獵白方右手·白方即時轉四平馬手抽拳在胸"@zh-hk ;
    mao:has_description "Zak zoeng: White figure counters with side palm strike(zak zoeng) aimed at Black figure's chest. Black figure simultaneously blocks with daan gung sau. | Laap sau: in the same movement Black figure grabs Whitefigure's right arm,Simultaneously, White figure changeshis stance to sei ping maa and pulls his fists to the chest."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Grab_and_break_guard_A_09"@en .

