    mao:has_description "進馬平搥:白方進左馬，右平搥打向黑方胸部，黑方左手穿橋擋住，接著出右平搥，白方再以左手獵手消去 | 白方右平搥打向黑方，黑方左手手消去，白方上右馬、黑方拉左馬"@zh-hk ;
    mao:has_description "Zeon maa ping ceoi: White figures takes a left step forwardand pulls a right punch (ping ceo) to Black figure's chestBlack fiqure blocks with left cyun kiu sau and counters withright ping ceoi, which White figure deflects with zou laap sau | Zeon maa ping ceoi: White fiqure throws a right ping ceoi at Black figure. Black fiqure deflects with zou laap sau. White figure then steps forward on the right while Black figurepulls back on the left."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Advance_with_straight_punch_B_10"@en .

###  https://purl.org/maont/ontologygffk_dc_A_11
mao:gffk_dc_A_11 rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                   mao:Form_move ;
    mao:in_form mao:gffk_dc_seqA ;
    mao:spars_against mao:gffk_dc_B_11 ;
    mao:has_component mao:gffk_dc_pair_11 ;
    mao:has_component mao:block_kick ;
    mao:has_description "右掛搥:白方上右馬後右手掛挺打向黑方頭部，黑方單弓手擋掛槌護頭 | 扭馬轉身:黑方擋住白方拳馬上扭其手關節至後,白方扭馬轉身以防關節被鎖，同時左爪叉頸，黑方握住白方手腕·雙方一起走馬轉方向，白方再打掛搥，黑方手開，用右手檔頭 | 扭馬頂踭:白方用左手頂踭頂向黑方右手·黑方手鬆開"@zh-hk ;
    mao:has_description "Jau gwaa ceoi: White figure takes a right step forward and strikes at Black figure's head with you gwaa ceoi. Black figure blocks with an overhead daan gung sau. | Nau maa zyun san: Black figure blocks White figure's punchand twists his arm backward at the elbow. White figuretwists his stance to prevent himself from getting into alock and grabs the opponent's neck with a left claw-handBlack figure holds White figure's wrist, Both sides shifttheir stances. White fiqure makes another gwaa ceoi whichforces Black figure to loosen his grip and block with hisright arm overhead. | Nau maa ding zaang: White figure thrusts his left elbow at Black figure's right hand, which again forces Black figure to loosen."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Leg_block_and_groin_kick_A_11"@en .

