    mao:has_description "日字搥:雙方右吊腳，黑方上右馬雙手日字搥打向白方腹部，白方同時上右馬雙膀手消去 | 獵手:白方以雙撒手捉著黑方上臂 | 破排手:黑方以破排手将白方的手鬆開然後攻擊白方，白方同樣以破排手法消去"@zh-hk ;
    mao:has_description "Jat zi ceoi: both sides suspend right leg. Black figure takes a right step forward and pulls a doube jat zi ceoi at White figure's abdomen, White figure also takes a right step forward and blocks with soeng bong sau. | Laap sau: White figure uses soeng laap sau to grab Blackfigure's upper arms. | Po pai sau: Black figure uses po pai sau to loosen White figure's grip and counters with palm strike. White figure also blocks and counters with po pai sau."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Rocket_hammer_fist_combination_B_26"@en .

