    mao:has_description "拉馬火箭搥:白方左弓步右拳平肩向前打出，黑方左弓步雙伏手 | 火箭搥:白方以連環火箭搥打向黑方，黑方拉馬穿橋將其消去"@zh-hk ;
    mao:has_description "Laai maa fo zin ceoi: White figure pulls a right punch at shoulder level in a left bow stance.Black figure blocks with soeng fok sau in left now stance. | Fo zin ceoi: White fiqure makes a consecutive fo zi ceoi at Black figure, who pulls back and blocks with cyun kiu sau."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Tiger_tail_kick_A_44"@en .

